The binary is a wasi-libc reactor (it imports wasi_snapshot_preview1 and
exports wasm_malloc), so it carries wasi-libc and the musl and cloudlibc code
wasi-libc is built from. These files were fetched from WebAssembly/wasi-libc's
main branch when it was at commit 165235bc467d.
The wasi-sdk and wasi-libc revisions the binary was built with are unknown:
it has no producers or name section, only target_features.

